# Play test of Glacier Station (CIPlay glacier_station, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the village on
# the east shore (3.4 m), the observatory on the peak (32 m), the crevasse in the west plateau, the reactor basin north.
# Quest "The Long Night" (20 steps): village, log, tool crate, fuse 1, 2 pages, observatory, its sign, locker, fuse 2,
# locker's tag, 4 pages, reactor basin, crevasse, the Queen, frozen crate, its tag, fuse 3, the vault, its seal, 6 pages.
island Glacier Station
expect step 0
expect title The Long Night

# The station village: the log, the tool crate's fuse and its tag
walk 88 -12 to 74 -12 h=3.4
zone village
expect step 1
read Station log
expect step 2
open Tool crate
expect story fuse 1
wait 1
expect step 4
read Tool crate
wait 1
expect step 5

# Up to the observatory along the trail and the peak's eased south flank
walk 72 -20 to 60 -30 to 40 -30 to 20 -30 to 10 -30 to 0 -40 to -10 -40 to -10 -30 to -10 -20 to -10 -17 h=29.3
zone observatory
expect step 6
read Observatory
expect step 7
open Observatory locker
expect story fuse 2
wait 1
expect step 9
read Observatory locker
wait 1
expect step 11

# The reactor is dead without three fuses, its vault sealed
use controls
expect message fuse sockets stand empty
zone reactor
expect step 12
open Reactor vault
expect message sealed
expect story fuse 2

# Down to the crevasse: the Polar Bear Queen in her den, Petrov's frozen crate
walk -10 -30 to -25 -24 to -40 -20 to -60 0 to -70 8 h=8.3
walk -70 8 to -78 -6 to -86 -20 to -91 -30 h=4.5
zone ravine
expect message the Queen
expect step 13
kill Polar bear
expect animals Polar bear 0
expect step 14
open Frozen crate
expect story fuse 3
expect step 15
read Frozen crate
wait 1
expect step 17

# The reactor restarted: its pool glows, the vault opens
use controls
expect message Three fuses click home
expect story fuse 0
expect shown reactorglow
open Reactor vault
expect item Blueprint_ElectricPurifier 1
expect step 18
read Reactor vault
wait 1
expect done
